1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,885
Hey everyone, welcome back to the kitchen!

2
00:00:04,185 --> 00:00:07,329
Today we're making a big Saturday breakfast.

3
00:00:07,629 --> 00:00:12,873
Leo is in charge of grapes today, and he takes that job very seriously.

4
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:21,474
Mia picked every single berry in this bowl herself, and she wants you to know it.

5
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:26,860
Our kitchen rule: grown-ups slice, kids arrange.

6
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:34,584
And here's Noah, our tiniest taste tester.

7
00:00:34,884 --> 00:00:37,529
He mostly eats the blueberries.

8
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:52,399
While the pancakes cook, a quick thank you to today's sponsor, Sunny Oats.

9
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:55,319
Everyone gets a seat at the table.

10
00:01:13,820 --> 00:01:16,239
Mia says she'll do the dishes.

11
00:01:16,539 --> 00:01:18,409
We'll see about that.

12
00:01:18,709 --> 00:01:20,779
She always says that.

13
00:01:21,079 --> 00:01:23,613
Thanks for hanging out with us.

14
00:01:23,913 --> 00:01:26,063
See you next Saturday!
